<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-C.BANK FIXINGS FOR JULY 23/24.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-C.BANK FIXINGS FOR JULY 23/24.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Wednesday</p>
<p>set the following exchange rates for July 23/24. The kroon is</p>
<p>pegged at eight kroons to a German mark.</p>
<p>	    July 23/24	July 22/23</p>
<p>    CZK    0.42384	     0.41819</p>
<p>    DKK    2.10203	     2.10093</p>
<p>    FIM    2.71623	     2.71177</p>
<p>    GBP   24.61892	    24.1696</p>
<p>    HUF    0.07495	     0.0747</p>
<p>    LTL    3.65618	     3.6115</p>
<p>    LVL   25.30577	    25.09947</p>
<p>    RUR    0.00253	     0.0025</p>
<p>    SEK    1.86754	     1.85062</p>
<p>    UAH    7.87786	     7.78005</p>
<p>    USD   14.628		14.446</p>
<p>    XEU   15.87065	    15.81765</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
